neutral-atoms-September-24-2026.html#cor:first-ionization","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:18eedb91c3b3619c56ce77e17a3d102a01c7e849d19f5b34c759c63e24421787","file":"preprints/Uniform-excess-charge-for-Coulomb-molecules-and-the-outer-radius-of-neutral-atoms-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":80,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"f5cbcb29ecad0799fe8138c4ae4158d777c83f00ebfe551773c37e233e887996","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Uniform-excess-charge-for-Coulomb-molecules-and-the-outer-radius-of-neutral-atoms-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:18eedb91c3b3619c56ce77e17a3d102a01c7e849d19f5b34c759c63e24421787","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Uniform-excess-charge-for-Coulomb-molecules-and-the-outer-radius-of-neutral-atoms-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L80"},"statement_kind":"corollary","text":"\\label{cor:first-ionization}\nFor the full nonrelativistic Coulomb atom specified above, with integer\nnuclear charge $Z\\ge1$, one-electron kinetic term $-\\Delta/2$, and two\nelectron spin states, write $E_Z(n)=E(n,Z)$. There are universal constants\n$0<c\\le C<\\infty$ such that the first ionization energy of the neutral atom\nsatisfies\n\\[\n c\\le I_1(Z):=E_Z(Z-1)-E_Z(Z)\\le C\n \\qquad\\text{for every integer }Z\\ge1.\n\\]"}
